      "text": "Is not the life more than meat, Matt. 6:25 (3 Ne. 13:25). workman is worthy of his meat, Matt. 10:10. I was an hungred, and ye gave me meat, Matt. 25:35. he that hath meat, let him do likewise, Luke 3:11. My meat is to do the will of him that sent me, John 4:34. Labour not for the meat which perisheth, John 6:27. my flesh is meat indeed, John 6:55. abstain from meats offered to idols, Acts 15:29. kingdom of God is not meat and drink, Rom. 14:17. have fed you with milk, and not with meat, 1 Cor. 3:2. meat commendeth us not to God, 1 Cor. 8:8. did all eat the same spiritual meat, 1 Cor. 10:3. Let no man … judge you in meat, or in drink, Col. 2:16. commanding to abstain from meats, 1 Tim. 4:3 (D&C 49:18). have need of milk, and not of strong meat, Heb. 5:12. for one morsel of meat sold his birthright, Heb. 12:16.",
